    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Hackignite 1.0 is a national-level 24-hour hackathon organised by Computer Science and Engineering (CSE/AIML) at Jain College of Engineering and Technology, Hubballi, on 12th and 13th of December 2026.</p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Open to undergraduate students from recognized colleges across India.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Each team must consist of 3&ndash;4 members.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Every participant must carry a valid college ID card.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Registration Fees:</strong> Rs 2000 per team</p>\n<p>Have any queries : <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>https://hk-seven-psi.vercel.app/</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Domains:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Web development</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>App development</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Important Dates:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div><strong>28/11/2026</strong> Last date for registration.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div><strong>12/12/2026</strong> Hackathon begins.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div><strong>13/12/2026</strong> Hackathon ends.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>24 Hours of Non-Stop Innovation</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Exciting Cash Prize (Prize Pool upto <strong>Rs 40,000</strong>)</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Hands-on Coding and Development</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Industry-Oriented Problem Solving</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Project Demonstrations and Evaluation</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Physical Certificates for All Participants</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules and Regulations:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>All participants must complete registration before the deadline.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Each team must have a minimum of 3 and a maximum of 4 members.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Team members cannot be changed after registration.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Participants must carry their valid college ID cards.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>All project development must take place during the hackathon period.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Pre-built projects will not be accepted as original hackathon submissions.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Use of AI tools is permitted.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Plagiarism or copying other teams projects may lead to disqualification.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Teams must present their working prototype during the final evaluation.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>The judges decision will be final.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>",
